Partiduo is an invoicing and accounting application for small businesses,
self-employed and liberal professions (France, Belgium). This package
installs the instance server of the production distribution
(aloli-crystal/partiduo-dist): core, Bulma web interface and all
extensions, each enabled per instance, with the PDF converter of the
MODELES extension.

Several instances run on one server, one daemon each, under
/usr/local/etc/rc.d/partiduo. The development version (partiduo-app-devel)
installs in its own directory and can run alongside.
